1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:04,467
Circle it. The canvas becomes the prompt.

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:07,667
TRACE gives the agent the object, not a screenshot.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,133
It draws the forces, solves the motion,
and moves the block.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,933
Cross out friction.
Every dependent answer updates.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,867
Same gesture. Messier problem.

6
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:26,633
One arrow cannot explain a world war.
TRACE restores the decisions and sources.

7
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:34,667
Remove one decision. The path bends
instead of pretending history was fixed.

8
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:43,667
Fourteen native WebMCP tools. Called live.
Human and agent on one surface.

9
00:00:45,333 --> 00:00:47,933
The canvas is the prompt.
